{"id":46161,"ord":8,"n_segments":152,"prev":46160,"next":46162,"doc":{"id":"56712","title":"56712_Cootie Williams oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Cootie Williams","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/56712/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=56712"},"chapter":"Family and Mobile boyhood","title":"Afraid of his father's whippings","category":"family_childhood","summary":"Cootie was the only one of the brothers afraid of their father's whippings and so was careful to behave.","period":"1910s","year_from":1910,"year_to":1919,"words":137,"start":[16,15],"end":[17,20],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=56712#s46161","tags":{"places":[],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[],"story":{"theme":47,"theme_name":"Growing up and learning music: family, first instruments, teachers","community":117,"community_name":"Where I came from: parents, siblings and birth","core":true},"blocks":[{"p":16,"b":15,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Not too much --"},{"p":16,"b":16,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"No."},{"p":16,"b":17,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"-- because I was afraid of my father."},{"p":16,"b":18,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Oh, you were."},{"p":16,"b":19,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":16,"b":20,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Why? Was he that strict or that removed from you, or what?"},{"p":16,"b":21,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah. In a way. I was about the only"},{"p":17,"b":0,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"one afraid of him."},{"p":17,"b":1,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"You were?"},{"p":17,"b":2,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":17,"b":3,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Why weren't the others?"},{"p":17,"b":4,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"They didn't mind getting those whuppings."},{"p":17,"b":5,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Oh."},{"p":17,"b":6,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"And I did."},{"p":17,"b":7,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"I see."},{"p":17,"b":8,"s":"","x":"(Laughter)"},{"p":17,"b":9,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"They just took it in their stride, huh?"},{"p":17,"b":10,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":17,"b":11,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"So you would be a little careful not to do things that would bring it on, huh?"},{"p":17,"b":12,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"That's right."},{"p":17,"b":13,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":17,"b":14,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"He used to whip my youngest brother and I used to cry. But --"},{"p":17,"b":15,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"When he whipped your youngest brother, you used to cry?"},{"p":17,"b":16,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"Yeah."},{"p":17,"b":17,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Oh."},{"p":17,"b":18,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"And about the next hour, he'd be doing the same thing over again."},{"p":17,"b":19,"s":"MS. DANCE","x":"Oh. So he didn't really care."},{"p":17,"b":20,"s":"MR. WILLIAMS","x":"No."}]}